\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cbank head says will  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  if flows lumpy\b0\par\par\uc2 503 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 2010\par 04:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 * \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  cbank will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if flows lumpy, volatile-head\par \par \uc2 * Cbank will take steps to ease liquidity situation: deputy (Updates with quotes, details, background, deputy comments)\par \par \uc2 By Rajesh Kumar Singh\par \par \uc2 CHANDIGARH, \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Oct 15 (Reuters) - The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if inflows turn lumpy and volatile, its governor said on Friday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Thursday bought dollars to stem the rupee's strength, traders had said -- a move which they believe was the RBI's first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2010. [ID:nSGE69D0EX]\par \par \uc2 "We are watching the exchange rate situation. Our policy is quite clear, which we have said a number of times that we will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if flows are lumpy or volatile or if it disrupts the macro-economic situation," Duvvuri Subbarao said.\par \par \uc2 "That remains our policy," he told reporters at a press conference after the RBI's board meeting in the northern Indian state, but declined comment when asked if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had indeed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 Subbarao said he would not elaborate on when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will or will not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  has attracted a record $22.5 billion in inflows into stocks this year, which have put an upward pressure on the rupee.\par \par \uc2 Since the start of September, the rupee <INR=IN> has appreciated 6.8 percent on foreign equity inflows of more than $9.5 billion, pushing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to a more than 25-month high.\par \par \uc2 India must manage capital inflows so that it can fund its current account deficit while at the same time not harming exports, Deputy Governor Subir Gokarn had said on Thursday. [ID:nSGE69E03S]\par \par \uc2 TEMPORARY LIQUIDITY SQUEEZE\par \par \uc2 Outflows towards state-run \uc2 Coal India\uc2 's initial public offering to raise up to $3.5 billion in the country's biggest initial public offering (IPO) have been squeezing liquidity in the banking system.\par \par \uc2 The world's largest coal miner's IPO will open on Monday.\par \par \uc2 "This IPO may add pressure (on liquidity) at least temporarily, so it is something that we will look at and if the circumstances warrant, we will think about responding," deputy governor Subir Gokarn said at the press conference.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been reluctant to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, but may be forced to in coming weeks as foreign investors are expected to pour in billions of dollars to buy shares in the country's largest-ever IPO. [ID:nSGE69A09L]\par \par \uc2 Traders said an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at current levels would serve two purposes -- infuse liquidity into the system, which has a deficit of over 800 billion rupees according to the liquidity adjustment auction, and prevent sharp appreciation of the rupee.\par \par \uc2 Another deputy governor Shyamala Gopinath also said on Friday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was closely monitoring the liquidity situation and would take appropriate actions as and when needed. (Writing by Swati Bhat; editing by Malini Menon)\par \par \uc2 INDIA-CBANK/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|SNI|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101015e6af00046\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
