\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cbank head says will  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  if flows lumpy\b0\par\par\uc2 130 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 2010\par 09:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 CHANDIGARH, \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Oct 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Duvvuri Subbarao said on Friday the \uc2 Reserve Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  was watching the exchange rate situation and will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market if inflows are lumpy and volatile.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had bought dollars to stem the rupee's strength on Thursday -- a move which traders believe was the first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this year. [ID:nSGE69D0EX]\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  must manage capital inflows so that it can fund its current account deficit while at the same time not harming exports, a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  deputy governor had said on Thursday. [ID:nSGE69E03S] (Reporting by Rajesh Kumar Singh; editing by Malini Menon)\par \par \uc2 INDIA-CBANK/ (URGENT)|LANGEN|SNI|ABN|M|E|RBN|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101018e6af000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
