\par\par \b \uc2 INDIA NEWS HIGHLIGHTS:Top Economic/Equities Stories Of The Day\b0\par\par\uc2 724 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 2010\par 11:03\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =2ND UPDATE: INFOSYS SECOND QUARTER NET BEATS ESTIMATES, UP 13.2% \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Infosys Technologies Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . Friday beat market expectations to report a 13.2% rise in its second-quarter net profit, and raised its forecast for the fiscal year, thanks to sustained demand for outsourcing services. (published 0643 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par RBI SUBBARAO: TO \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INTERVENE\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  IN \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  MARKET IF INFLOWS VOLATILE \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets if capital inflows are particularly volatile and threaten to disrupt financial stability in the fast-expanding economy, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Reserve Bank of India\f28 \uc2 \f2  Governor Duvvuri Subbarao said Friday. (published 0707 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =UPDATE: INDIA SEPTEMBER INFLATION RISES; RATE HIKE ON CARDS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 India's inflation accelerated slightly in September as heavy rains damaged crops and limited food supplies, raising the odds that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will tighten monetary policy further next month. (published 0651 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =UPDATE: INDIA SEEKS BIDS FOR 34 OIL, GAS EXPLORATION BLOCKS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 India Friday launched its ninth round of oil and gas field auctions with a hope that recent easing of state-control over pricing of gasoline and natural gas and global economic recovery will help it attract more foreign companies to explore its vastly unexploited sedimentary basin. (published 0627 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =UPDATE: INDIAN OIL CHAIRMAN: EXPECT JULY-SEPTEMBER REVENUE LOSS AT INR67 BLN \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 State-run Indian Oil Corp. is likely to incur a revenue loss of INR67 billion in the July-September quarter due to selling fuels at state-set discounted prices, its chairman said Friday. (published 0814 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =UPDATE: TATA MOTORS NANO MINICAR OUTPUT HIT BY PARTS SHORTAGE - VENDORS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Executives at two parts suppliers to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Tata Motors Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said India's largest auto maker by sales is producing only about half of its original target for Nano minicar due to a shortage of engine and sheet metal parts. (published 0859 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par TATA MOTORS SEPTEMBER GLOBAL SALES 86,996, UP 19% ON YEAR \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Tata Motors Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 ., India's largest auto maker by sales, Friday said its global automobile sales surged 19% in September from a year earlier to 86,996 vehicles. (published 0733 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par VODAFONE: MOVED COURT AS INDIA TAX BODY CHANGED ARGUMENT \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.K.-based \f28 \uc2 \f2 Vodafone Group PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  said Friday it has filed a petition in the Bombay High Court against the Indian tax department in a tax case related to its 2007 purchase of a majority stake in an Indian telecommunications company. (published 0654 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par STATE BANK OF INDIA CHAIRMAN: PLAN TO ISSUE MORE RETAIL BONDS \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 State Bank of India\f28 \uc2 \f2 , the country's largest lender by assets, plans to issue retail bonds on a frequent basis to fund its capital requirements, its chairman said Friday. (published 0723 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 RELIANCE INDUSTRIES\f28 \uc2 \f2  PRICES TWO-PART $1.5B DOLLAR DEAL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 India's \f28 \uc2 \f2 Reliance Industries Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . priced a total of $1.5 billion in a two-part dollar-denominated bond deal Thursday. (published 2209 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par HEIDELBERGCEMENT INDIA 3Q NET PROFIT SLUMPS 90%; SALES DOWN 19% \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 HeidelbergCement India Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . Friday reported a 90% drop in third-quarter net profit to INR28.2 million from INR270.5 million a year earlier. (published 0632 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par EROS INTERNATIONAL: INDIAN UNIT SIGNS TV LICENSING DEAL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Eros International PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2 , an integrated player in the Indian media and entertainment sector, said Friday that \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eros International Media Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 , or EIML, the Company's Indian subsidiary, has closed a multi-film content licensing deal worth INR 64 crores, for exclusive broadcasting of certain Eros movies across Zee Entertainment's television network. (published 0711 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par PIRAMAL SUNTECK REALTY WINS BID TO DEVELOP PROPERTY IN MUMBAI \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Piramal Suntech Realty Pvt. Ltd., a joint venture between Suntech Realty Ltd. and Ajay \f28 \uc2 \f2 Piramal Group\f28 \uc2 \f2 , said Friday it has won a bid to develop a 8,230 square meter plot in Mumbai. (published 0731 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par       ======== DOW JONES NEWSWIRES ANALYSIS AND COMMENTARY ======== \par  \par =HEARD ON THE STREET: THE SMALL PRINT ON INDIA'S BIG IPO \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Eager for a dip in India's energy market, foreigners are at last being offered a way in. This one comes with more small print than just what's in the IPO prospectus. (published 0707 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =CHARTING INDIA: \f28 \uc2 \f2 INFOSYS TECHNOLOGIES\f28 \uc2 \f2  MAY RISE TO INR3,300 \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The short-term outlook for \f28 \uc2 \f2 Infosys Technologies Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . is bullish, and charts are supportive of a rise to the action-reaction line target of INR3,300. (published 0310 GMT) [ 15-10-10 0903GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 62501   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020101015e6af000pn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
