\par\par \b \uc2 RPT- \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  would  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 forex \highlight\uc2  if needed-cenbank\b0\par\par\uc2 315 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Oktober 2010\par 04:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  (Repeats story issued on Sunday)\par \par \uc2  MUMBAI, Oct 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets if needed to maintain stability, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's governor said during a panel discussion at the International Monetary Fund in Washington on Saturday.\par \par \uc2  Foreign institutional investors have pumped a record $21.3 billion into Indian equities so far this year, helping push the rupee <INR=IN> to a 25-month high last week.\par \par \uc2  The \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2 , whose official view on the level of the rupee is uncertain and typically \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  only to soften sharp moves in the partially convertible \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has refrained from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  during the recent rupee rally.\par \par \uc2  "If the inflows are lumpy and volatile or if they disrupt the macroeconomic situation, we will do so," RBI Governor Duvvuri Subbarao said of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2  A surge in fund flows into faster-growing emerging economies has prompted several to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to head off appreciation and protect exports.\par \par \uc2  "Our \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be to keep liquidity conditions consistent with activity in the real economy and to maintain financial stability and not to stand against developments driven by changing economic fundamentals," Subbarao said according to a text of his remarks published on the RBI website on Sunday.\par \par \uc2  He said \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  because its absorption of inflows has increased as the current account deficit widens on a surge in imports on an upbeat outlook for growth and investment.\par \par \uc2  "Economies that have current account surpluses or only small deficits have \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . That does not mean we won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Subbarao said.\par \par \uc2  He said the Indian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue to use macro-prudential instruments in order to maintain stability, noting for example a recent move to tighten rules for bank lending against stocks.  (Reporting by Tony Munroe; Editing by Greg Mahlich)    \par \par \uc2 INDIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (REPEAT)|LANGEN|SNI|DNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020101011e6ab0003x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw427\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal6405\pichgoal600
