\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Official: RBI May  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  If Rupee-Dollar Hits INR43-INR42\b0\par\par\uc2 520 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Oktober 2010\par 14:19\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    (Adds comments from official, analyst) \par  \par    By Prasanta Sahu \par    Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 NEW DELHI (Dow Jones)--India's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  may move to cap gains in the rupee if it rises to 43-42 against the U.S. dollar, though \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is unlikely at current levels, a senior finance ministry official said Thursday after the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  hit a 25-month high against the greenback.\f28 \par \par \uc2 "At the moment, foreign institutional investments have not reached a point where the government and the \uc2 Reserve Bank of India\uc2  need to lose sleep," the official told Dow Jones Newswires on condition of anonymity.\par \par \uc2 But he added that authorities are monitoring the rupee's movements "very carefully."\par \par \uc2 The dollar was changing hands at INR44.19 in late trade Thursday after hitting INR44.12 in session, a level not seen since September 2008.\par \par \uc2 Unlike many of its Asian peers, the RBI has stayed away from \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, despite a recent surge in capital inflows. Foreign funds pumped in $5.43 billion in September alone, and the rupee gained 3.3% in the July-September quarter.\par \par \uc2 "The (down) move in the USD/INR has been rapid and, if it persists, could increase \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  concerns regarding volatility and competitiveness (of exports)," said Priyanka Chakravarty, a foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at Standard Chartered Bank.\par \par \uc2 The finance ministry official added that a fresh rush of foreign capital inflows could push the rupee up further, hurting exporters.\par \par \uc2 Coal India\uc2 's $3 billion-$3.5 billion share sale, the country's biggest ever initial public offering, is likely to attract foreign investors when it opens on Oct. 18, resulting in large dollar inflows.\par \par \uc2 "(The) export sector has to be protected and it (impact on exporters) will definitely be a factor that will be at the back of the mind of the RBI governor while he takes a decision," the official said.\par \par \uc2 RBI Governor D.Subbarao has prioritized taming inflation in the world's second-most populous country, where more than 70% of residents live on less than $2 a day. The relative strength of the rupee, Asia's second best-performer in September, helps curb imported inflation.\par \par \uc2 India's foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves rose 0.4% in the past year, the least among Asia's 10 biggest economies. China's holdings rose by 15%, Japan's 2% and South Korea's 16%.\par \par \uc2 "RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as of now, looks unlikely because the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  may end up boosting liquidity, which it doesn't want," a senior trader with a German bank said.\par \par \uc2 Finance Secretary Ashok Chawla, who is in the U.S. ahead of the International Monetary Fund meeting in Washington this weekend, said Wednesday strengthening \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  across the developing world is likely to be a hot topic at the meeting.\par \par \uc2 But he downplayed concerns over the strength of the rupee, saying that while it may weigh on exporters, it also helps the purchasing power of importers.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Prasanta Sahu & Abhrajit Gangopadhyay, Dow Jones Newswires; 91-11-43563301 abhrajit.gangopadhyay@dowjones.com \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 [ 07-10-10 1219GMT ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020101007e6a700140\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
