\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  cbank did not  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  in  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  market in May\b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Juli 2010\par 11:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MUMBAI, July 14 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 India\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in May for the sixth straight month, indicating global risk aversion that caused the rupee to weaken was taken in its stride.\par \par \uc2 The rupee <INR-IN> had fallen to 47.75 per dollar in May, its weakest since Oct.1, 2009.\par \par \uc2 The details of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  data are available on:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_ViewBulletin.aspx?Id=11421"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.rbi.org.in/scripts/BS_ViewBulletin.aspx?Id=11421}}}\par \par \uc2 The rupee's fortunes are closely linked to flows into and out of the stock market. Foreigners pulled out about $2 billion in May from the Indian equity market, compared with an inflow of $2.1 billion in April.\par \par \uc2 Foreign funds have purchased a net of around $8 billion of stocks in the year to date, adding to record inflows of $17.5 billion in 2009.\par \par \uc2 In 2009, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold a net $5.8 billion to prevent the rupee from depreciating sharply.\par \par \uc2 The rupee had dropped to a record low of 52.2 in early March 2009, but it ended the fiscal year 2009/10 up 4.7 percent boosted by large foreign fund inflows and periodic \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . (Reporting by Suvashree Dey Choudhury; editing by Surojit Gupta)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 INDIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 |LANGEN|SNS|SNI|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020100714e67e000jl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
