\par\par \b \uc2 INDIA NEWS HIGHLIGHTS:Top Economic/Equities Stories Of The Day\b0\par\par\uc2 650 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 6 April 2010\par 11:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones Capital Markets Report\par \uc2 CM\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par =UPDATE:U.S.-INDIA COOPERATION KEY FOR STABILITY, GROWTH -GEITHNER \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The ability of the U.S. and India to cooperate on economic and financial issues will be critical to global efforts to create a more stable global financial system and balanced economic growth, U.S. Treasury Secretary Timothy Geithner said Tuesday. (published 0832 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =2ND UPDATE: COAL INDIA EXPECTS TO LIST SHARES IN AUGUST \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Coal India Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 ., the world's largest coal producer by output, is looking to list its shares in August, the state-run company's chairman said. (published 0836 GMT)\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INDIA CENTRAL BANK\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  LIKELY \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 INTERVENED\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  IN \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 FOREX\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  MARKET - DEALERS \f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 India\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is suspected to have \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market by buying dollars to halt the rupee's gains, three dealers said Tuesday. (published 0424 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par =GMR INFRASTRUCTURE: IN TALKS WITH BANKS TO REFINANCE $837 MLN LOAN \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 India's \f28 \uc2 \f2 GMR Infrastructure Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . is in talks with banks to refinance a $837 million bridge loan it took in 2008 to buy a 50% stake in the Netherlands-based \f28 \uc2 \f2 InterGen NV\f28 \uc2 \f2 , a senior GMR executive said. (published 0744 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par TEMASEK STILL IN TALKS WITH INDIA GMR TO BUY ENERGY SHARES -OFFICIAL \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Temasek Holdings\f28 \uc2 \f2 , the Singapore state investment firm, is still in "advanced discussions" with India's \f28 \uc2 \f2 GMR Infrastructure Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . to buy a stake in its energy unit, said Wong Kim Yin, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Temasek\f28 \uc2 \f2 's managing director for investment. (published 0342 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par INDIA JANUARY-MARCH PRIVATE EQUITY INVESTMENTS RISE TO $2 BLN \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Private equity firms' investments in India rose at its fastest pace in 18 months in the January-March period to $2 billion, Venture Intelligence said Tuesday. (published 0319 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par WELSPUN GUJARAT IN TALKS TO PICK UP STAKE IN SAUDI COMPANY - EXECUTIVE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 India's Welspun Gujarat Stahl Rohren Ltd. --a mid-sized steel pipe maker--is in talks to pick up equity in Saudi Arabia-based \f28 \uc2 \f2 Aziz Pipes Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 ., a Welspun executive said Tuesday. (published 0542 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 RELIGARE ENTERPRISES\f28 \uc2 \f2  NAMES \f28 \uc2 \f2 SUNIL GODHWANI\f28 \uc2 \f2  AS NEW CHAIRMAN, MANAGING DIRECTOR \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Indian financial services company \f28 \uc2 \f2 Religare Enterprises Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . Tuesday named \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sunil Godhwani\f28 \uc2 \f2  as the new chairman and managing director of the company, taking over from \f28 \uc2 \f2 Malvinder Mohan Singh\f28 \uc2 \f2 , who has also stepped down from the board. (published 0738 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par UNITECH APPOINTS ADVISERS FOR RESTRUCTURING \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Unitech Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 ., one of India's largest real-estate developers, Tuesday appointed advisers to restructure its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . (published 0848 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 PUNJ LLOYD\f28 \uc2 \f2  GETS 2 ORDERS WORTH INR2.35 BILLION \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Punj Lloyd Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . said Tuesday it has received two orders worth a total INR2.35 billion from \f28 \uc2 \f2 Engineers India Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . and \f28 \uc2 \f2 Mangalore Refinery & Petrochemicals Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . . (published 0753 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par HINDUSTAN PETROLEUM AIMS TO RAISE AT LEAST INR5 BLN VIA BONDS - SOURCES \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Hindustan Petroleum Corp. Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . aims to raise at least INR5 billion through bonds, two people familiar with the matter said Tuesday. (published 0447 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par UNITED PHOSPHORUS AIMS TO RAISE INR3 BLN VIA BONDS - SOURCE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 United Phosphorus Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . aims to raise INR3 billion by selling bonds, a person familiar with the development said Tuesday. (published 0547 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par RBS INDIA UNIT SELLS RESIDENTIAL PROPERTY FOR INR370 MILLION - SOURCE \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The Indian unit of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Royal Bank of Scotland Group PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  has sold a duplex residential apartment in Mumbai to an unnamed buyer for about INR370 million, a person involved in the deal said Tuesday. (published 0803 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par  \par DRUVA SOFTWARE GETS $5 MLN FUNDING FROM SEQUOIA, INDIAN ANGEL NETWORK \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 India's Druva Software has received $5 million in funding from Sequoia Capital and Indian Angel Network to finance its expansion in global markets, the company said Tuesday. (published 0650 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par       ======== DOW JONES NEWSWIRES ANALYSIS AND COMMENTARY ======== \par  \par =CHARTING INDIA: DECCAN CHRONICLE MAY RALLY TO INR180.05 \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Deccan Chronicle Holdings Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . appears to have resumed its short-term uptrend, and charts suggest that the stock could rally to the March 22 swing high of INR180.05. (published 0316 GMT) [ 04-06-10 0500ET ]\f28 \par \par \uc2 62501   \par \par \uc2 Dokument CM00000020100406e6460005v\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
