\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE:  \highlight22\uc2 India \highlight\uc2  Adviser: Large Capital Flows Give New Dimension To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 506 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Februar 2010\par 16:30\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2010 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 (Adds more comments from Rangarajan, RBI's Subbarao, background)\par \par \uc2 By Nupur Acharya & Bijou George\par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 MUMBAI (Dow Jones)--Capital inflows into India have begun to dominate the balance of payments, giving a new dimension to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, a top adviser to the Prime Minister said Tuesday.\par \par \uc2 "The extent of accumulation of reserves, and the degree of sterilization, influence the growth of money supply," C. Rangarajan, chairman of the Prime Minister's Economic Advisory Council said in a speech.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has to take a view on the permissible expansion of money supply in the context of large capital inflows," he said.\par \par \uc2 Rangarajan said if there were limits to sterilization, the accumulation of reserves would have to be limited.\par \par \uc2 Sterilization, in terms of RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , is the process in which the bank drains excess rupees from the market by selling special \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  bonds. The excess rupees arise when the RBI \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, buying dollars.\par \par \uc2 The government has to pay interest to investors to subscribe to the special \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  debt, which adds to its fiscal burden.\par \par \uc2 "Capital inflows have come to dominate the balance of payments and the exchange rate may begin to appreciate even if there is a significant current account deficit because of large capital flows," Rangarajan said.\par \par \uc2 India has historically run a deficit on its current account, which has been mostly financed by large capital inflows into India, the world's second-fastest-growing major economy.\par \par \uc2 Rangarajan said that no \b \highlight22\uc2 monetary authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  can afford to ignore prolonged volatility or misalignment in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 "However, the framework evolved is such that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stabilize the exchange rate has to be an exception than the rule."\par \par \uc2 Double Digit Inflation Unlikely\par \par \uc2 Rangarajan said that an inflation rate of 5%-6% may be considered appropriate. "I don't see the prospect of double-digit inflation," he said.\par \par \uc2 Most analysts are predicting wholesale inflation to reach double digits by the end of the fiscal year to March 31.\par \par \uc2 Wholesale price growth is already above the RBI's revised estimate of 8.5% for the fiscal year, with inflation hitting a 15-month high of 8.56% in January, preliminary data showed Monday.\par \par \uc2 "It is possible that if the rabi [winter-sown] crop is good, and there is every prospect that the rabi crop is going to be good, then it may have a moderating influence [on inflation]," Rangarajan said.\par \par \uc2 RBI Governor Subbarao, speaking at the same event, said growth was as important as price stability for a developing economy like India.\par \par \uc2 "In the Reserve Bank, we cannot be pure inflation-targeters to the exclusion of growth concerns. So we have to keep both price stability and growth in view and now increasingly as a result of the crisis --financial stability."\par \par \uc2 -By Bijou George & Nupur Acharya, Dow Jones Newswires; 91 22 61456113; djn.in@dowjones.com [ 16-02-10 1530GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020100216e62g000xp\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
